@startuml Boxes and Donations Use Cases

title Use cases: boxes, donations and stock
caption Target design. Boxes and donations. Decisions O14, O22, O31, D3, D15, O6. ADRs 0011, 0013, 0014.

left to right direction

actor Donor as donor <<external>>
actor Loader as loader
actor Dispatcher as disp
actor Administrator as admin

rectangle "Freedom" {
  usecase "Record a donation\nand its donor" as UC1
  usecase "Create an expected box" as UC2
  usecase "Check a box in at a hub" as UC3
  usecase "Place a box in a bay" as UC4
  usecase "Record items: category,\nvalue, expiry" as UC5
  usecase "Attest a box" as UC6
  usecase "Print the bilingual label" as UC7
  usecase "Replace an attested box" as UC8
  usecase "Review hub stock" as UC9
  usecase "Produce a donor status report" as UC10
  usecase "Maintain categories and\ntheir customs codes" as UC11
  usecase "Assign Loaders to locations" as UC12
  usecase "Erase a donor" as UC13
}

donor ..> disp : emails HQ\n(no system access)

disp --> UC1
loader --> UC1
disp --> UC2
loader --> UC2
loader --> UC3
loader --> UC4
loader --> UC5
loader --> UC6
loader --> UC7
loader --> UC8
loader --> UC9
disp --> UC10
loader --> UC10
admin --> UC11
admin --> UC12
admin --> UC13
admin --> UC6

UC6 ..> UC7 : <<precedes>>
UC8 ..> UC6 : <<include>>

note right of UC4
  Loader only, even narrower
  than attesting a box.
end note

note right of UC9
  A Loader sees only the
  locations they manage (O14).
end note

@enduml
